      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "\"5. Employee representatives who are assigned to labor-management joint activities under Section 2 of this Order and are paid out of union or other private funds for the time so spent shall not also be paid by the City for such time. An employee who is granted a full or part-time assignment with pay and benefits pursuant to this Order shall be required to submit an affidavit to the head of the agency in which he is employed certifying that he is not receiving any compensation for the same time for which he is paid by the City.\"",
